  "summary": "DeepTide is an agentic coding assistant shipped as a macOS native app, a Bun-based cross-platform CLI (a thin wrapper around @paean-ai/zero-cli), and a Rust CLI with an optional desktop GUI; the repo also hosts a local DeepSeek V4 Flash inference runtime (ds4/dsgo) and quantization docs describing local-mode constraints. Evidence coverage: 130 of 315 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
